update kb_entries set content = replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(replace(content, $q$| **Status** | Lifecycle: {neutral:Not Started}, {accent:In Progress}, {success:Completed}, {purple:Paused}, {danger:Cancelled}. Stays Not Started while the project is in Draft. |$q$, $q$| **Stage** | The project's one lifecycle: {neutral:Draft}, {gold:Awaiting Start}, {accent:Active}, {orange:Closing}, {purple:Paused}, {success:Closed}, {danger:Cancelled}. Set by actions (Start Project, Pause/Resume, Cancel, Close Project), never typed in. Tags on Active projects: {gold:Ready to close} (every task Done or Cancelled) and {slate:Ongoing}. See [[Completing & Closing a Project]]. |$q$), $q$| **Phase** | Pipeline stage. Not Started = Backlog / Queued. In Progress = Scoping / Design / Development / Evaluation / Delivery. Completed = Done (automatic). Paused or Cancelled freeze the phase where it was. |$q$, $q$| **Phase** | Where an **Active** project is in production: Scoping, Design, Development, Evaluation, Delivery. Set to Done automatically when the project is Closed. Paused or Cancelled freeze it where it was. |$q$), $q$| **WBS Status** | Where the plan is: Draft, Awaiting Start, Start Project Declined, Baseline Locked, Changed After Baseline, Ongoing (Training Delivery and Ongoing containers), Closed. |$q$, $q$| **WBS Status** | Older field, now covered by **Stage** and hidden from ready-made views. Changes to the plan after Start are kept in the project's Audit Trail, not shown as a status. |$q$), $q$- **Completed** projects: {success:Completed on time} if$q$, $q$- **Closed** projects: {success:Completed on time} if$q$), $q$- Progress at 100% but Status not yet Completed: {success:Done on time · close pending} or {gold:Done late · close pending}.$q$, $q$- Progress at 100% but not Closed yet: {success:Done on time · close pending} or {gold:Done late · close pending}.$q$), $q$| **Start / Due** | Planned dates. Locked once the baseline is approved;$q$, $q$| **Start / Due** | Planned dates. Locked once Start Project is approved;$q$), updated_by = 'e7e52a30-4c13-449b-889d-280dc0ca16c6', updated_at = now() where article_number = 14;
