update kb_entries set content = replace(replace(content, $q$## Projects & Tasks

$q$, $q$## Projects & Tasks

### One Stage for every project
Status, WBS Status and Phase used to tell overlapping stories. Every project now has **one Stage**: {neutral:Draft} → {gold:Awaiting Start} → {accent:Active} → {orange:Closing} → {success:Closed}, plus {purple:Paused} and {danger:Cancelled}. Stage isn't typed in; it moves when you **Start Project**, **Pause / Resume**, **Cancel**, or **Close Project**. There's no separate "mark Completed" step any more: approving **Close Project** sets the project to Closed. Active projects show a **Ready to close** tag when every task is Done or Cancelled, and **Ongoing** for Training Delivery and Ongoing containers. Phase (Scoping, Design, Development, Evaluation, Delivery) stays as the detail inside Active.
**Related articles:** [[Completing & Closing a Project]] · [[Projects: Terms & Columns]]

$q$), $q$and the first agreed dates are now kept as **Committed** dates$q$, $q$every project has one **Stage**, and the first agreed dates are now kept as **Committed** dates$q$), updated_by = 'e7e52a30-4c13-449b-889d-280dc0ca16c6', updated_at = now() where article_number = 30;
